--[[
    Level 14 - Crystal Depths
    A long crystal cave. New enemies:
      crystal beetle  sees you on its floor, shakes (warning!), then charges.
                      Jump over it - it gets dazed if it hits a wall.
      cave bat        hangs from the ceiling and swoops down when you pass.
      the Shade (M)   can't be hurt. Wakes up when you come close and chases
                      you. Run! It's a bit slower than you, can't jump, can't
                      fit in 1-tile tunnels, never walks up to a checkpoint,
                      and gives up when you get far enough away.

    start -> beetle -> first Shade room (jump the platforms to sneak past,
    or run and shrink into the tunnel) -> the split hall. Three ways on:
      UP    Bat Heights   Small only: drop into the spring notch. Pillars over
                          spikes, bats, Small tunnels.
      ON    Shade Run     fastest: three sleeping Shades under shelves - each
                          wakes as you drop in front of it. Gaps let you escape
                          (or fall down into the mines).
      DOWN  Crystal Mines drop through the hole. Smash the cracked walls as
                          Big, charging beetles, the most gems.
    All three meet in the big cave. Springs up to the passage, drop in front
    of the last Shade and run for the flag.

    Legend:  . empty   # rock   = amethyst block   C cracked rock (Big)
             ^ crystal shards   v shards on a ceiling   P pump   * gem
             E crystal beetle   B cave bat   M the Shade   J spring
             x y z  glowing crystals (purple / orange / silver)
             S start   G goal   H checkpoint
]]

